                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="452 1732 452 1744 2219 1749 2224 1727 2219 1697 2154 1684 2152 1684 2150 1684 2148 1684 2130 1695 2024 1684 2022 1684 2020 1684 1990 1695 1968 1684 1966 1684 1964 1684 1897 1695 1871 1684 1868 1684 1866 1684 1780 1695 1728 1684 1726 1684 1723 1684 1682 1695 1656 1684 1654 1684 1652 1684 1650 1684 1648 1684 1632 1695 1559 1684 1557 1684 1554 1684 1531 1695 1487 1684 1485 1684 1483 1684 1481 1684 1479 1684 1463 1697 1373 1697 1340 1684 1338 1684 1336 1684 1232 1697 673 1686 671 1686 608 1697 569 1686 567 1686 565 1686 450 1699 452 1732"/>
